### 1. Login as employee (saves the token for the next calls)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "employee1", "password": "Employee#123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2. Protected call WITHOUT a token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me

### 3. Protected call WITH the token -> 200 and your identity
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Employee on a supervisor endpoint -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
